    <div begin="00:23.920" end="03:07.440">
      <p begin="00:23.920" end="00:28.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:23.920" end="00:24.310">ま</span><span begin="00:24.310" end="00:24.870">だ</span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.540">居</span><span begin="00:25.700" end="00:26.340">れ</span><span begin="00:26.440" end="00:26.800">ば</span><span begin="00:27.190" end="00:27.470">い</span><span begin="00:27.470" end="00:27.850">い</span><span begin="00:27.850" end="00:28.190">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再待一会也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再待一會也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You can stay a little longer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">조금 더 있어도 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu peux rester encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Puedes quedarte un poco más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du kannst ruhig noch ein wenig bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pode ficar mais um pouco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можешь ещё остаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Puoi restare ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mada ireba ii yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:29.590" end="00:33.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:29.590" end="00:29.860">い</span><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.230">か</span><span begin="00:30.350" end="00:30.580">な</span><span begin="00:30.700" end="00:30.900">く</span><span begin="00:31.080" end="00:31.300">て</span><span begin="00:31.480" end="00:31.740">も</span><span begin="00:32.240" end="00:32.720">いい</span><span begin="00:32.930" end="00:33.370">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不用离开也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不用離開也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You don't have to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가지 않아도 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu n’es pas obligé de partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hace falta que te vayas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du musst nicht gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não precisa ir embora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можешь никуда не уходить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non devi andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikanakute mo ii yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.260" end="00:39.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:35.260" end="00:35.640">そ</span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:36.310">ば</span><span begin="00:36.450" end="00:36.910">に</span><span begin="00:37.210" end="00:37.700">い</span><span begin="00:37.870" end="00:38.240">て</span><span begin="00:38.590" end="00:38.900">い</span><span begin="00:38.900" end="00:39.260">い</span><span begin="00:39.260" end="00:39.680">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以待在我身边啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可以待在我身邊啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You can stay here by my side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 곁에 있어도 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu peux rester près de moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Puedes quedarte a mi lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du kannst ruhig bei mir bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pode ficar ao meu lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можешь остаться рядом со мной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Puoi restare accanto a me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soba ni ite ii yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:40.970" end="00:44.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.280">い</span><span begin="00:41.390" end="00:41.650">か</span><span begin="00:41.770" end="00:42.040">な</span><span begin="00:42.120" end="00:42.330">く</span><span begin="00:42.500" end="00:42.750">て</span><span begin="00:42.890" end="00:43.180">も</span><span begin="00:43.630" end="00:44.160">いい</span><span begin="00:44.320" end="00:44.660">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不用离开也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不用離開也可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You don't have to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가지 않아도 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu n’es pas obligé de partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hace falta que te vayas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du musst nicht gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não precisa ir embora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можешь никуда не уходить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non devi andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikanakute mo ii yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:48.000" end="00:50.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.170">部</span><span begin="00:48.170" end="00:48.460">屋</span><span begin="00:48.460" end="00:48.610">の</span><span begin="00:48.610" end="00:49.300">奥</span><span begin="00:49.450" end="00:49.630">の</span><span begin="00:49.630" end="00:50.000">影</span><span begin="00:50.090" end="00:50.450">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">房间深处的影子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">房間深處的影子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The shadow deep inside the room</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">방 안 깊숙한 곳의 그림자가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L’ombre au fond de la pièce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La sombra al fondo de la habitación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Schatten tief im Zimmer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A sombra no fundo do quarto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тень в глубине комнаты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L’ombra in fondo alla stanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Heya no oku no kage ga</span></p>
      <p begin="00:50.820" end="00:53.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:50.820" end="00:51.120">薄</span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.330">く</span><span begin="00:51.410" end="00:51.670">な</span><span begin="00:51.670" end="00:52.010">り</span><span begin="00:52.280" end="00:52.400">途</span><span begin="00:52.500" end="00:52.660">絶</span><span begin="00:52.660" end="00:52.820">え</span><span begin="00:53.000" end="00:53.370">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐淡去 直至消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸淡去 直至消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Faded away until it disappeared</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">희미해지다 이내 사라졌어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S’est estompée puis s’est évanouie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se fue desvaneciendo hasta desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verblasste langsam und verschwand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi desvanecendo até desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поблекла и исчезла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Si è fatta tenue fino a svanire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Usuku nari todaeta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:55.120" end="00:56.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:55.120" end="00:55.560">雨</span><span begin="00:55.640" end="00:55.790">の</span><span begin="00:55.790" end="00:56.510">後</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨过之后</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雨過之後</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">After the rain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">비가 그친 뒤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Après la pluie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Después de la lluvia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach dem Regen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Depois da chuva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">После дождя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dopo la pioggia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ame no ato</span></p>
      <p begin="00:59.390" end="01:01.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:59.390" end="00:59.630">木</span><span begin="00:59.630" end="00:59.980">霊</span><span begin="00:59.980" end="01:00.120">し</span><span begin="01:00.250" end="01:00.690">た</span><span begin="01:00.850" end="01:01.250">言</span><span begin="01:01.250" end="01:01.410">葉</span><span begin="01:01.550" end="01:01.840">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些曾回荡的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些曾迴盪的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the words that once echoed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">메아리치던 말들도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les paroles qui résonnaient en écho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso las palabras que hicieron eco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch die Worte die einst widerhallten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até as palavras que ecoaram</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже слова что отзывались эхом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche le parole che riecheggiavano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kodama shita kotoba mo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:02.310" end="01:05.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:02.310" end="01:02.730">届</span><span begin="01:02.730" end="01:02.970">か</span><span begin="01:02.970" end="01:03.250">な</span><span begin="01:03.250" end="01:03.620">い</span><span begin="01:03.830" end="01:04.030">もう</span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.240">二</span><span begin="01:04.240" end="01:04.400">度</span><span begin="01:04.540" end="01:05.050">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也再也无法传达</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也再也無法傳達</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Will never reach beyond again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 두 번 다시 닿지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne parviendront plus jamais jusqu’à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no llegarán nunca más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Erreichen dich nie wieder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não chegam nunca mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Уже никогда не достигнут тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non arriveranno mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Todokanai mou nido to</span></p>
      <p begin="01:06.590" end="01:08.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:06.590" end="01:07.090">朝</span><span begin="01:07.090" end="01:07.320">の</span><span begin="01:07.320" end="01:08.060">匂</span><span begin="01:08.060" end="01:08.180">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晨的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">清晨的氣息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The scent of morning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아침의 향기</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le parfum du matin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El aroma de la mañana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Duft des Morgens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O aroma da manhã</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Запах утра</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il profumo del mattino</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Asa no nioi</span></p>
