      <p begin="01:27.440" end="01:31.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:27.440" end="01:28.080">ら</span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:28.740">ら</span><span begin="01:28.840" end="01:29.430">ら</span><span begin="01:29.640" end="01:30.260">ら</span><span begin="01:30.350" end="01:31.540">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lá lá lá lá lá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лалалалала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ra ra ra ra ra</span></p>
      <p begin="01:32.070" end="01:34.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:32.070" end="01:32.300">こ</span><span begin="01:32.300" end="01:32.470">ん</span><span begin="01:32.470" end="01:32.670">な</span><span begin="01:32.670" end="01:32.850">に</span><span begin="01:32.850" end="01:33.250">も</span><span begin="01:33.250" end="01:34.050">美</span><span begin="01:34.050" end="01:34.220">し</span><span begin="01:34.300" end="01:34.640">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此美麗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 아름답고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si beau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan hermoso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wunderschön</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão belo assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно красиво</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così meravigliosamente bello</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo utsukushiku</span></p>
      <p begin="01:34.980" end="01:38.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:34.980" end="01:35.190">こ</span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:35.350">ん</span><span begin="01:35.350" end="01:35.560">な</span><span begin="01:35.560" end="01:35.710">に</span><span begin="01:35.710" end="01:35.970">も</span><span begin="01:36.050" end="01:36.760">哀</span><span begin="01:36.760" end="01:36.970">し</span><span begin="01:36.970" end="01:37.090">く</span><span begin="01:37.200" end="01:38.120">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此悲傷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably sorrowful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 슬퍼서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y tan triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und so unendlich traurig</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão triste assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно печально</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così profondamente triste</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo kanashikute</span></p>
      <p begin="01:38.550" end="01:42.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:38.550" end="01:39.470">涙</span><span begin="01:39.470" end="01:39.660">の</span><span begin="01:40.020" end="01:40.330">行</span><span begin="01:40.330" end="01:40.720">き</span><span begin="01:40.720" end="01:40.920">場</span><span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.210">は</span><span begin="01:41.440" end="01:41.680">もう</span><span begin="01:41.770" end="01:41.920">無</span><span begin="01:41.920" end="01:42.200">い</span><span begin="01:42.200" end="01:42.510">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水已经无处可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">淚水已經無處可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There's nowhere left for these tears to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">눈물이 갈 곳은 이제 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes larmes n’ont désormais plus nulle part où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las lágrimas ya no tienen adónde ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Für meine Tränen gibt es keinen Ort mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não há para onde as lágrimas possam ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слёзам больше некуда идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai non c’è più un posto per le lacrime</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namida no ikiba wa mou nai yo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:43.480" end="01:46.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:43.480" end="01:43.690">こ</span><span begin="01:43.690" end="01:43.870">ん</span><span begin="01:43.870" end="01:44.070">な</span><span begin="01:44.070" end="01:44.280">に</span><span begin="01:44.280" end="01:44.460">も</span><span begin="01:44.580" end="01:45.310">騒</span><span begin="01:45.310" end="01:45.510">が</span><span begin="01:45.510" end="01:45.730">し</span><span begin="01:45.730" end="01:46.030">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此喧嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此喧囂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably restless</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 소란스럽고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tumultueux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con tanto bullicio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So voller Unruhe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão tumultuado assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно шумно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così pieno di rumore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo sawagashiku</span></p>
      <p begin="01:46.400" end="01:49.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:46.400" end="01:46.570">こ</span><span begin="01:46.570" end="01:46.760">ん</span><span begin="01:46.760" end="01:46.980">な</span><span begin="01:46.980" end="01:47.150">に</span><span begin="01:47.150" end="01:47.380">も</span><span begin="01:47.470" end="01:48.150">愛</span><span begin="01:48.150" end="01:48.370">し</span><span begin="01:48.370" end="01:48.500">く</span><span begin="01:48.620" end="01:49.520">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此令人眷恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此令人眷戀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably dear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 애틋해서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si cher à mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así tan entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und doch so unendlich kostbar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão querido assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно дорого сердцу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così immensamente caro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo itoshikute</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.910" end="01:58.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:49.910" end="01:50.330">そ</span><span begin="01:50.330" end="01:50.650">れ</span><span begin="01:50.650" end="01:50.900">で</span><span begin="01:50.900" end="01:51.110">も</span><span begin="01:51.400" end="01:51.630">い</span><span begin="01:51.740" end="01:52.120">つ</span><span begin="01:52.120" end="01:52.370">か</span><span begin="01:52.370" end="01:52.620">は</span><span begin="01:52.830" end="01:53.020">止</span><span begin="01:53.190" end="01:53.590">ま</span><span begin="01:53.590" end="01:53.830">る</span><span begin="01:53.830" end="01:54.760">の</span><span begin="01:55.320" end="01:55.930">で</span><span begin="01:56.070" end="01:58.830">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 终有一天也会停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 終有一天也會停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And yet someday it will all come to an end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 언젠가는 멎어 버리겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant un jour tout cela finira sans doute par s’arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero algún día también se detendrá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und dennoch wird auch das irgendwann enden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim um dia tudo isso vai parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же однажды это наверное прекратится</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure un giorno tutto questo si fermerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo itsuka wa tomaru no deshou</span></p>
      <p begin="02:18.870" end="02:24.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:18.870" end="02:19.540">ら</span><span begin="02:19.610" end="02:20.260">ら</span><span begin="02:20.310" end="02:20.950">ら</span><span begin="02:21.030" end="02:21.660">ら</span><span begin="02:21.710" end="02:23.150">ら</span><span begin="02:23.190" end="02:24.050">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">La la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">La la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lá lá lá lá lá lá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лалалалалала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ra ra ra ra ra ra</span></p>
      <p begin="02:24.590" end="02:29.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:24.590" end="02:25.240">ら</span><span begin="02:25.310" end="02:25.980">ら</span><span begin="02:26.040" end="02:26.650">ら</span><span begin="02:26.710" end="02:27.430">ら</span><span begin="02:27.480" end="02:29.780">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lá lá lá lá lá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лалалалала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ra ra ra ra ra</span></p>
