      <p begin="02:36.050" end="02:40.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:36.050" end="02:36.670">ら</span><span begin="02:36.750" end="02:37.430">ら</span><span begin="02:37.470" end="02:38.100">ら</span><span begin="02:38.170" end="02:38.870">ら</span><span begin="02:38.940" end="02:40.080">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lá lá lá lá lá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лалалалала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ra ra ra ra ra</span></p>
      <p begin="02:40.640" end="02:43.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:40.640" end="02:40.880">こ</span><span begin="02:40.880" end="02:41.020">ん</span><span begin="02:41.020" end="02:41.220">な</span><span begin="02:41.220" end="02:41.410">に</span><span begin="02:41.410" end="02:41.710">も</span><span begin="02:41.710" end="02:42.580">美</span><span begin="02:42.580" end="02:42.810">し</span><span begin="02:42.810" end="02:43.170">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此美麗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 아름답고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si beau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan hermoso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wunderschön</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão belo assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно красиво</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così meravigliosamente bello</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo utsukushiku</span></p>
      <p begin="02:43.490" end="02:46.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:43.490" end="02:43.710">こ</span><span begin="02:43.710" end="02:43.860">ん</span><span begin="02:43.860" end="02:44.060">な</span><span begin="02:44.060" end="02:44.220">に</span><span begin="02:44.220" end="02:44.500">も</span><span begin="02:44.590" end="02:45.280">哀</span><span begin="02:45.280" end="02:45.490">し</span><span begin="02:45.490" end="02:45.590">く</span><span begin="02:45.690" end="02:46.560">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此悲傷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably sorrowful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 슬퍼서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y tan triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und so unendlich traurig</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão triste assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно печально</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così profondamente triste</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo kanashikute</span></p>
      <p begin="02:47.100" end="02:50.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:47.100" end="02:48.010">涙</span><span begin="02:48.010" end="02:48.230">の</span><span begin="02:48.520" end="02:48.860">行</span><span begin="02:48.860" end="02:49.240">き</span><span begin="02:49.240" end="02:49.460">場</span><span begin="02:49.460" end="02:49.720">は</span><span begin="02:49.950" end="02:50.240">もう</span><span begin="02:50.320" end="02:50.530">無</span><span begin="02:50.530" end="02:50.710">い</span><span begin="02:50.710" end="02:50.970">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水已经无处可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">淚水已經無處可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There's nowhere left for these tears to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">눈물이 갈 곳은 이제 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes larmes n’ont désormais plus nulle part où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las lágrimas ya no tienen adónde ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Für meine Tränen gibt es keinen Ort mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não há para onde as lágrimas possam ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слёзам больше некуда идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai non c’è più un posto per le lacrime</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namida no yukiba wa mou nai yo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:52.060" end="02:54.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:52.060" end="02:52.300">こ</span><span begin="02:52.300" end="02:52.450">ん</span><span begin="02:52.450" end="02:52.650">な</span><span begin="02:52.650" end="02:52.860">に</span><span begin="02:52.860" end="02:53.040">も</span><span begin="02:53.140" end="02:53.890">騒</span><span begin="02:53.890" end="02:54.050">が</span><span begin="02:54.050" end="02:54.240">し</span><span begin="02:54.240" end="02:54.520">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此喧嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此喧囂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably restless</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 소란스럽고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tumultueux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con tanto bullicio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So voller Unruhe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão tumultuado assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно шумно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così pieno di rumore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo sawagashiku</span></p>
      <p begin="02:54.930" end="02:58.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:54.930" end="02:55.040">こ</span><span begin="02:55.040" end="02:55.300">ん</span><span begin="02:55.300" end="02:55.520">な</span><span begin="02:55.520" end="02:55.700">に</span><span begin="02:55.700" end="02:56.040">も</span><span begin="02:56.040" end="02:56.720">愛</span><span begin="02:56.720" end="02:56.960">し</span><span begin="02:56.960" end="02:57.110">く</span><span begin="02:57.190" end="02:58.050">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此令人眷恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此令人眷戀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably dear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 애틋해서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si cher à mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así tan entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und doch so unendlich kostbar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão querido assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно дорого сердцу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così immensamente caro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo itoshikute</span></p>
      <p begin="02:58.480" end="03:07.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:58.480" end="02:58.890">そ</span><span begin="02:58.890" end="02:59.240">れ</span><span begin="02:59.240" end="02:59.460">で</span><span begin="02:59.460" end="02:59.680">も</span><span begin="02:59.980" end="03:00.210">い</span><span begin="03:00.300" end="03:00.680">つ</span><span begin="03:00.680" end="03:00.930">か</span><span begin="03:00.930" end="03:01.150">は</span><span begin="03:01.410" end="03:01.620">止</span><span begin="03:01.790" end="03:02.170">ま</span><span begin="03:02.170" end="03:02.420">る</span><span begin="03:02.420" end="03:03.550">の</span><span begin="03:03.960" end="03:04.630">で</span><span begin="03:04.860" end="03:07.440">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 终有一天也会停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 終有一天也會停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And yet someday it will all come to an end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 언젠가는 멎어 버리겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant un jour tout cela finira sans doute par s’arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero algún día también se detendrá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und dennoch wird auch das irgendwann enden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim um dia tudo isso vai parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же однажды это наверное прекратится</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure un giorno tutto questo si fermerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo itsuka wa tomaru no deshou</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
